<b>{ECO_NAME}<\/b><\/font><br /><font size='3'><font color='#808080'>Realm:<\/font> {REALM}<br /><font color='#808080'>Biome:<\/font> {BIOME_NAME}<\/font><br /><font size='4'> <\/font><br /><font color='#808080' size='3'>{NNH_NAME} <\/font><br /><font size='2'>{expression/expr0} <\/font><\/div>","showAttachments":false,"expressionInfos":[{"name":"expr0","title":"Nature Needs Half","expression":"var nnh = $feature.NNH\nWhen (\n(nnh == 1), \"More than 50% of the total ecoregion area is already protected.\",\n(nnh == 2), \" Less than 50% of the total ecoregion area is protected but the amount of remaining unprotected natural habitat could bring protection to over 50% if new conservation areas are added to the system.\",\n(nnh == 3), \"The amount of protected and unprotected natural habitat remaining is less than 50% but more than 20%. Ecoregions in this category would require restoration to reach Half Protected.\",\n(nnh == 4), \"The amount of protected and unprotected natural habitat remaining is less than or equal to 20%. Achieving half protected is not possible in the short term and efforts should focus on conserving remaining, native habitat fragments.\",\n\"\"\n)","returnType":"string"}],"mediaInfos":[]},"layerDefinition":{"defaultVisibility":true}}]}